#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:4 e6dee53f40a649eda7818d0a0d331670
msgid "认识用户工作台"
msgstr "Getting to know the workbench"

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:7 823b5976fef7419fada6d8b8008fe909
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:9 f38d9424f3bf42578ecfeb902efc8534
msgid "让用户登录后知道从哪里开始，以及如何快速判断平台是否正常。"
msgstr ""
"After login, show users where to start and how to quickly tell whether the "
"platform is running normally."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:12 eaf417bffdae4a9a930a83e0cf309a5a
msgid "进入方式"
msgstr "How to access"

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:14 42a6238f56d9413499aafd57bc80b63d
msgid "登录成功后自动进入工作台；也可以点击左侧菜单 ``工作台`` 随时回到该页 面。"
msgstr ""
"After login you enter the workbench automatically; you can also click "
"``Workbench`` in the left menu anytime."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:18 6d33616d63224a70aa23447e752b4cd6
msgid "页面内容"
msgstr "Page contents"

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:20 01f48831eb06477dbea4e504f6083bbb
msgid "工作台由若干卡片组成，依次为："
msgstr "The workbench consists of several cards, in order:"

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:22 8fc75797fa734464bd97d3fe50a155a4
msgid "``快捷操作``：三个常用入口按钮 ``应用管理`` ``通知中心`` ``帮助文档``。"
msgstr ""
"``Quick Actions``: three common entry buttons ``Application Management``, "
"``Notification Center``, and ``Help Docs``."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:24 91b756eff40c4f8ab5d67fa843ffd51f
msgid "``账户概览``：显示用户名、状态、显示名称、用户余额、项目数量、未读通 知数。"
msgstr ""
"``Account Overview``: username, status, display name, balance, project "
"count, and unread notifications."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:26 644c3357ba58416193c55a81f732ce8e
msgid ""
"``作业统计``：近 7 天作业数量，含 ``运行中`` ``排队中`` ``24h完成`` ``24h失败`` 四个计数；下方是 ``最近作业`` "
"表格。"
msgstr ""
"``Job Statistics``: job counts for the last 7 days, including ``Running``, "
"``Queued``, ``Completed in 24h``, and ``Failed in 24h``; below is the "
"``Recent Jobs`` table."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:28 e7ee6fe04cfd4f7997434128952cb1e9
msgid "``平台通知``：显示最近若干条通知摘要，每条含标题、类型、发布时间， 右上角 ``查看全部`` 进入完整通知列表。"
msgstr ""
"``Platform Notifications``: recent notification summaries with title, type, "
"and time; ``View All`` opens the full list."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:30 4a57b87f681e45118503eb5c4900457e
msgid "``平台状态``：显示集群在线状态，``2 / 2`` 表示 2 个可用集群共 2 个， ``0`` 异常节点。"
msgstr ""
"``Platform Status``: cluster online status; ``2 / 2`` means 2 of 2 clusters "
"available, ``0`` abnormal nodes."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:32 8a6d14bac52a4f5695edaece76bb05c5
msgid "``我的项目组``：列出所属项目组卡片，含组名、ID、CPU/GPU/内存配额。"
msgstr ""
"``My Project Groups``: cards for your groups with name, ID, and "
"CPU/GPU/memory quotas."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:35 95a49eccfacd4781a0eb3d464097b6b0
msgid "正常结果"
msgstr "Expected result"

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:37 e4aa3122947f4e49ae67ba51291b0292
msgid "进入工作台后可以看到自己的账号信息、最近作业和通知，不需要任何额外操 作。"
msgstr ""
"On the workbench you see your account information, recent jobs, and "
"notifications—no extra steps required."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:44 630861e8c3494d639ed0df4e392c441c
msgid "普通用户工作台"
msgstr "Regular user workbench"

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:44 2a2c167295454190a65f2bf8485fb68f
msgid "普通用户工作台全景，包含快捷操作、账户概览、作业统计、平台通知、平 台状态和我的项目组。"
msgstr ""
"Overview of the regular user workbench: shortcuts, account overview, job "
"statistics, notifications, platform status, and my project groups."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:48 bdebd77ad0b84e009a7c200f6475a0e7
msgid "使用建议"
msgstr "Tips"

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:50 23ee658b28ab44d8b845fa11769382b6
msgid "想启动应用 → 点击 ``快捷操作`` 中的 ``应用管理``，或左侧菜单 ``应用列表``。"
msgstr ""
"To start an app → click ``Application Management`` under ``Quick Actions``, "
"or ``Application List`` in the left menu."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:52 b8a97558bde64172bb408d72f1a2d0dc
msgid "想看通知 → 点击 ``快捷操作`` 中的 ``通知中心``。"
msgstr ""
"To view notifications → click ``Notification Center`` under ``Quick "
"Actions``."

#: ../../docs/login/workbench.rst:53 dd0536869c734e069194921fbfadd509
msgid "想看项目组 → 滚动到工作台最下方的 ``我的项目组`` 卡片，或点击左 侧菜单 ``项目组管理``。"
msgstr ""
"To view project groups → scroll to ``My Project Groups`` at the bottom of "
"the workbench, or click ``Project Group Management`` in the left menu."
